WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.645
The side we never see.

00:02.345 --> 00:07.681
The Moon turns once for every trip round the Earth, so the same face always looks at us.

00:08.131 --> 00:09.896
This is the other one.

00:10.346 --> 00:17.105
It gets just as much sunlight as the side we know: there is no dark side of the Moon, only a far side.
